# AUTHORS
#
# Everyone who has contributed to this tree, in the order they first did.
#
# A name is added in the commit that first carries it, and the form is the one
# `.mailmap` maps to: `Proper Name <address>`.  That file is the authority when
# a person has committed under more than one address, so a name here is the
# proper name and an address here is the one `.mailmap` resolves to.
#
# This file is **history**.  Who is responsible for which part now is
# `MAINTAINERS`, and the two answer different questions: a contributor who has
# moved on stays here, and a maintainer who takes over a subsystem is an entry
# there.
#
# The prose in this tree is CC BY 4.0 and the code is Apache-2.0; `NOTICE` says
# which files fall on which side.

